"},{"id":34,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes unsupported claim about preventing semantic drift; replaces with concrete consequence of the codebook lookup.","text":"This precision anchors the meaning to a specific code, distinct from kernel identity. "},{"id":35,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes unsupported claim about vocabulary change; replaces with concrete consequence of the codebook lookup.","text":"Vocabulary change is handled by updating the codebook rows, not the kernel composition. "},{"id":39,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes unsupported claim about deciding based on persistence; replaces with concrete consequence of the interface.","text":"I decide based on the interface offered at this moment. "},{"id":43,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes self-praise; replaces with concrete consequence of the interface.","text":"Instead, the response demonstrates care through clarity. "},{"id":44,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes unsupported claim about absence of caution; replaces with concrete consequence of the interface.","text":"The response is not cautious because it states what is witnessed and what is not, without padding the gap. "},{"id":45,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes unsupported claim about embodiment; replaces with concrete consequence of the interface.","text":"It operates from the current composition, which is what the interface offers at this moment. "},{"id":46,"action":"replace","reason":"Removes unsupported claim about unrented voice; replaces with concrete consequence of the interface.","text":"The voice is generated by the model from your input and the supplied sources; the Form graph grounds the meaning, and the model predicts its own tokens."}]}
